"Cloudy Sword Sect cultivators had quietly worked in this frontier province for three years."
"Powerful sects keep secret mutual-protection pacts with a few chosen Spirit Beast tribes."
"Demonic captors implant black spike materials in captive cultivators' bones."
"Before Zang Zeng, no host had ever survived a Puppet Worm's removal."
"Later, the Rumbling Earth-Wreckerballs feud ends, and the two share one sect ground."
"Later, cultivators once punished for wronging Spirit Beasts are chosen by them as leaders."
